# Photo Frame schedule — CLIENT frame (display only).
# This frame pulls the primary's prepared playlist + cache; it does NOT scan the
# NAS or build playlists. Install with:  crontab deploy/crontab.client
#
# The primary's 07:15 rebuild finishes anywhere from ~07:25 to 08:00+, so sync.sh
# runs every 10 minutes 07:20-11:50 and only pulls once the primary's files.txt is
# dated today (earlier runs log "not ready"; later runs exit silently). Nightly
# blank/wake are the same as the primary.
#
# m h  dom mon dow   command
0  7   *   *   *     /home/pi/wake.sh                                     # power the panel back on
20-59/10 7 * * *    /home/pi/sync.sh >> /home/pi/sync.log 2>&1           # pull once the primary has rebuilt
*/10 8-11 *   *   *  /home/pi/sync.sh >> /home/pi/sync.log 2>&1           # (keep trying through late morning)
30 22  *   *   *     /home/pi/sleep.sh                                    # power the panel off at night
# OS updates: unattended-upgrades (security only) — see deploy/apt/.
